Package: intent
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: Intent contributors <intent@local.invalid>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Suggests: poppler-utils, tesseract-ocr, xdotool, wmctrl
Homepage: https://github.com/Pranav5255/Intent
Description: Local-first activity memory for Ubuntu (intentd daemon, CLI and companions)
 Intent records consented desktop, shell, Firefox, VS Code and workspace file
 activity on this machine only, turns each day into a tree of work "intents"
 and helps you resume where you left off.
 .
 This package provides the intentd user service (one native process with an
 HTTP API on 127.0.0.1:9477), the intentctl CLI and shell hooks, the GNOME
 Shell focus extension for Wayland, and the bundled browser/editor companions
 when they were built. Nothing is enabled until a user runs "intentctl enable".
